            "title": "Restore Reviewed Payment Service Pool Configuration",
            "source_uri": "obsidian://sample-vault/payment-service/runbooks/payment-service-restore-reviewed-pool-config.md",
            "excerpt": "The proposal must include:\n\n- Current configuration.\n- Last reviewed configuration.\n- Supporting evidence.\n- Expected effect.\n- Deployment method.\n- Verification checks.\n- Rollback condition.\n\nFor the synthetic HTTP 503 scenario, the proposed change is to restore `pool_size` from 4 to 40 while keeping `max_overflow` at 0.",
